@startuml 04_level2_p3
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FEF3C7

title PPMP - Level 2 decomposition of 3.0
rectangle "Department Preparer" as E
usecase "4.0\nReview and Decide on Submitted Versions" as P4
usecase "6.0\nRecord Audit Events and Notifications" as P6
database "D1 Identity and Access\nusers, departments, memberships, roles,\npermissions, role assignments, sessions" as D1
database "D2 Planning Reference Data\nfiscal years, planning groups, owner mappings,\nitems, units, expense objects, annual prices,\nfunds, methods, allocations, workflow templates" as D2
database "D3 PPMP Plans and Versions\nplan identities, version headers,\nversion items, quarterly quantities, snapshots" as D3
database "D4 Private Attachments\nversion-linked metadata and file objects" as D4
database "D5 Review Records\nreview instances, assigned stages,\nappend-only decisions and comments" as D5
usecase "3.1\nLoad Authorized Draft and Reference Data" as P31
usecase "3.2\nValidate Items and Calculate Quarter Totals" as P32
usecase "3.3\nValidate and Store Private Attachments" as P33
usecase "3.4\nSave Draft or Create Revision" as P34
usecase "3.5\nFreeze and Submit Version" as P35
usecase "3.6\nBuild Process Audit Event" as P36

E --> P31 : F012 Draft, revision and submission request\n[DRAFT_REQUEST]
E --> P33 : F013 Attachment upload / retrieval / unlink\n[FILE_REQUEST]
P31 --> E : F014 Draft detail, totals and validation result\n[DRAFT_RESULT]
D1 --> P31 : F015 User and department permissions\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D2 --> P31 : F016 Owned groups, catalog, prices and rules\n[REFERENCE]
D3 --> P31 : F017 Existing plan and version content\n[PLAN_READ]
P34 --> D3 : F018 Draft content or immutable submitted version\n[DRAFT_WRITE]
D4 --> P33 : F019 Version attachment records and bytes\n[ATTACH_READ]
P33 --> D4 : F020 Validated draft attachments\n[ATTACH_WRITE]
D5 --> P31 : F021 Return comments and review status\n[REVIEW_READ]
P35 --> P4 : F022 Submitted version reference\n[SUBMISSION]
P36 --> P6 : F062 Process 3.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P31 --> P32 : 3.01 Authorized draft context\n[DRAFT_CONTEXT]
P32 --> P34 : 3.02 Validated quarterly values and totals\n[CALCULATED_DRAFT]
P32 --> P31 : 3.03 Field validation errors\n[DRAFT_RESULT]
P31 --> P33 : 3.04 Authorized attachment context\n[DRAFT_CONTEXT]
P33 --> P34 : 3.05 Validated attachment manifest\n[ATTACHMENT_MANIFEST]
P33 --> P31 : 3.06 Attachment result or authorized bytes\n[DRAFT_RESULT]
P34 --> P31 : 3.07 Saved draft or validation result\n[DRAFT_RESULT]
P34 --> P35 : 3.08 Saved version and submission intent\n[SAVED_DRAFT]
P35 --> P34 : 3.09 Frozen submission snapshot to persist\n[SUBMISSION]
P35 --> P31 : 3.10 Submission receipt or validation errors\n[DRAFT_RESULT]
P34 --> P36 : 3.11 Draft/revision change event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P33 --> P36 : 3.12 Attachment access/change event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P35 --> P36 : 3.13 Submission event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
legend bottom
Rectangle = external role; oval = data-transforming process
Cylinder = logical data store; arrow = named data payload
U groups all roles for shared login, reports and inbox functions.
Numbered process peers in Level 2 are outside the decomposed process.
Packet fields: FLOW_REGISTER.md; relationships: DATA_DICTIONARY.md
endlegend
@enduml
